OL,5,G1000 Bobby Friction
OL,6,     FBobby is joined by Excise Dept, a
OL,7,     Fmultilingual, genre-less
OL,8,     Fcollective from Mumbai, India,
OL,9,     Fahead of the release of their
OL,10,     Fsecond album SHOPNOBHUMI
OL,11,     F("Dreamland").
OL,12,G1300 Guy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,13,     FGuy chats to Glenn Richards of
OL,14,     FAustralian band the Augie March.
OL,15,     FThey toured together 25 years ago
OL,16,     Fso it's time for a catch-up.
OL,17,G1600 Jarvis Cocker
OL,18,     FJarvis takes us on a journey up to
OL,19,     Fthe Outer Hebrides courtesy of
OL,20,     Fauthor Douglas Stuart.
